000010 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000020 PROGRAM-ID. CONST1.
000030 DATA DIVISION.
000040 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000050 78  MAX-ITEMS                     VALUE 5.
000060 78  SHOP-NAME                     VALUE "CORNER STORE".
000070 01  TAX-RATE      CONSTANT AS     0.0775.
000080 01  TITLE-LEN     CONSTANT AS     LENGTH OF SHOP-NAME.
000090 01  PRICES.
000100     05  PRICE     PIC 9(3)V99     OCCURS MAX-ITEMS.
000110 01  HEADING-TXT   PIC X(TITLE-LEN).
000120 01  I             PIC 99.
000130 01  TAX           PIC 9(3)V99.
000140 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000150     MOVE SHOP-NAME TO HEADING-TXT
000160     DISPLAY "[" HEADING-TXT "] " TITLE-LEN " CHARACTERS"
000170     PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > MAX-ITEMS
000180         COMPUTE PRICE(I) = I * 10
000190     END-PERFORM
000200     COMPUTE TAX ROUNDED = PRICE(MAX-ITEMS) * TAX-RATE
